    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**ESCAPE THE FROZEN DEPTHS**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to *Frostcore* \u2014 a high-skill precision platformer set in a mysterious frozen space facility. Climb your way out of the depths using quick reflexes and pure determination. There are no enemies... only the world trying to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall is a lesson. Every checkpoint is a victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddca **Key Features**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Brutally challenging level design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3D platforming with physics-based movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cold, atmospheric sci-fi visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard and controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;One more try&quot; addictiveness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Future patch: Online multiplayer co-op planned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
